  "label": "User projected onto the visual material of the man's exaggerated emotional reaction",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man with East Asian features displaying an exaggerated expression of shock or excitement. This projection occurs because the meme uses the man's performative emotion as a visual stand-in for the sentiment 'a mother's love is like no other', creating an ironic or humorous contrast. The user, by viewing the meme, is implicitly identifying with or imagining themselves in the role of the person experiencing this exaggerated emotion, even though the text references maternal love. This projection is not explicit (e.g., no 'me' or 'you' text), but it is implied through the meme's format and the user's engagement with the juxtaposition.",
